{"id":"13.2","title":"Skal du på foreldremøte?","audio":"audio/13.2.mp3","duration":103.21,"synthetic":false,"sentences":[{"id":0,"start":0.15,"end":4.5,"text":"13.2 Skal du på foreldremøte?","heading":true,"zh":"13.2 你要去开家长会吗？","words":[[0,4,0.15,1.32,"13.2"],[5,9,2.2,2.96,"skal~0145ff0d5f10"],[10,12,2.96,3.2,"du"],[13,15,3.2,3.44,"på~4adb194eb020"],[16,28,3.44,4.42,"foreldremøte"]]},{"id":1,"start":6.75,"end":13.08,"text":"Leyla skal hente Ismail på skolen i dag fordi han skal til tannlegen.","zh":"莱拉今天要去学校接伊斯梅尔，因为他要去看牙医。","words":[[0,5,6.8,7.48,"leyla"],[6,10,7.48,7.74,"skal"],[11,16,7.74,8.34,"hente"],[17,23,8.34,9.08,"ismail"],[24,26,9.08,9.28,"på"],[27,33,9.28,9.72,"skolen"],[34,35,9.72,9.8,"i~de136e71704d"],[36,39,9.8,10.24,"dag"],[40,45,11.08,11.44,"fordi"],[46,49,11.44,11.74,"han"],[50,54,11.74,12.04,"skal~e65efaba04da"],[55,58,12.04,12.24,"til"],[59,68,12.24,12.93,"tannlegen"]]},{"id":2,"start":14.28,"end":18.77,"text":"På skolen møter hun Kari, mora til Eivind.","zh":"她在学校遇到了卡丽，埃温德的妈妈。","words":[[0,2,14.34,14.56,"på"],[3,9,14.56,15.18,"skolen"],[10,15,15.56,15.94,"møter~3af274b85884"],[16,19,15.94,16.14,"hun"],[20,24,16.14,16.7,"kari"],[26,30,17.5,17.9,"mora"],[31,34,17.9,18.14,"til~fe22a76f0dea"],[35,41,18.14,18.62,"eivind"]]},{"id":3,"start":20.46,"end":30.22,"text":"Hei, Leyla! Har du lest mail? Vi har fått innkalling til foreldremøte i neste uke. Skal du dit?","speaker":"Kari","zh":"你好，莱拉！你看邮件了吗？我们收到了下周开家长会的通知。你去吗？","words":[[0,3,20.52,20.96,"hei"],[5,10,20.96,21.45,"leyla"],[12,15,22.52,22.7,"har~8b9792170cca"],[16,18,22.7,22.9,"du"],[19,23,22.9,23.38,"lest"],[24,28,23.38,23.89,"mail"],[30,32,24.84,24.96,"vi"],[33,36,24.96,25.08,"har~8b9792170cca"],[37,41,25.08,25.32,"fått"],[42,52,25.32,25.96,"innkalling"],[53,56,25.96,26.36,"til~9af99ff4a231"],[57,69,26.36,27.43,"foreldremøte"],[70,71,27.58,27.68,"i"],[72,77,27.68,28.02,"neste~7e3b29d91cf1"],[78,81,28.02,28.45,"uke"],[83,87,29.32,29.58,"skal~0145ff0d5f10"],[88,90,29.58,29.72,"du"],[91,94,29.72,30.07,"dit"]]},{"id":4,"start":31.14,"end":31.77,"text":"Nei.","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"不去。","words":[[0,3,31.2,31.62,"nei"]]},{"id":5,"start":32.29,"end":33.16,"text":"Hvorfor ikke?","speaker":"Kari","zh":"为什么不去？","words":[[0,7,32.35,32.68,"hvorfor"],[8,12,32.68,33.02,"ikke"]]},{"id":6,"start":34.03,"end":37.62,"text":"Jeg … jeg tror ikke at jeg skal gå fordi læreren snakker så fort.","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"我……我想我不去了，因为老师说话太快了。","words":[[0,3,34.11,34.26,"jeg"],[6,9,34.26,34.36,"jeg"],[10,14,34.56,34.62,"tror"],[15,19,34.62,34.88,"ikke"],[20,22,34.88,35.04,"at"],[23,26,35.04,35.18,"jeg"],[27,31,35.18,35.42,"skal"],[32,34,35.42,35.74,"gå"],[35,40,35.92,36.12,"fordi"],[41,48,36.12,36.62,"læreren"],[49,56,36.62,37.08,"snakker"],[57,59,37.08,37.28,"så~996cf1d57573"],[60,64,37.28,37.54,"fort"]]},{"id":7,"start":38.84,"end":51.46,"text":"Men alle foreldre bør gå på foreldremøte. Det er viktig å vise barna våre at vi er interesserte i skolen deres, og det er veldig nyttig fordi vi får mye informasjon.","speaker":"Kari","zh":"可是所有家长都应该去开家长会。让孩子们看到我们关心他们的学校很重要，而且家长会很有用，因为我们能得到很多信息。","words":[[0,3,38.9,39.18,"men"],[4,8,39.18,39.56,"alle~6873d9584096"],[9,17,39.56,40.26,"foreldre"],[18,21,40.26,40.48,"bør"],[22,24,40.48,40.72,"gå~ee02d34100d5"],[25,27,40.72,40.88,"på~2e131cb042b9"],[28,40,40.88,41.81,"foreldremøte"],[42,45,42.48,42.6,"det~5e977a82af29"],[46,48,42.6,42.7,"er"],[49,55,42.7,43.35,"viktig"],[56,57,43.5,43.62,"å~0583da7a620a"],[58,62,43.62,44.06,"vise"],[63,68,44.06,44.46,"barna"],[69,73,44.46,44.89,"våre"],[74,76,45.02,45.12,"at"],[77,79,45.12,45.24,"vi"],[80,82,45.24,45.42,"er"],[83,95,45.42,46.38,"interesserte"],[96,97,46.38,46.52,"i~50052aac3f2e"],[98,104,46.52,46.9,"skolen"],[105,110,46.9,47.44,"deres"],[112,114,48.0,48.08,"og"],[115,118,48.08,48.2,"det"],[119,121,48.2,48.28,"er"],[122,128,48.28,48.6,"veldig"],[129,135,48.6,49.17,"nyttig"],[136,141,49.42,49.68,"fordi"],[142,144,49.68,49.82,"vi"],[145,148,49.82,50.2,"får"],[149,152,50.2,50.5,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[153,164,50.5,51.31,"informasjon"]]},{"id":8,"start":52.53,"end":56.86,"text":"Jeg vet ikke, for jeg forstår ikke alt læreren sier.","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"我不知道，因为老师说的话我不是全都听得懂。","words":[[0,3,52.59,52.76,"jeg"],[4,7,52.76,53.0,"vet"],[8,12,53.0,53.41,"ikke"],[14,17,54.04,54.26,"for~1b22712a94b1"],[18,21,54.26,54.62,"jeg"],[22,29,54.62,55.14,"forstår"],[30,34,55.14,55.42,"ikke"],[35,38,55.42,55.76,"alt"],[39,46,55.76,56.2,"læreren"],[47,51,56.2,56.71,"sier"]]},{"id":9,"start":57.85,"end":70.37,"text":"Du kan sitte sammen med meg, og jeg kan forklare deg litt. Det blir fint for deg å treffe læreren, og foreldremøter er en fin måte å bli kjent med de andre foreldrene på.","speaker":"Kari","zh":"你可以和我坐在一起，我可以给你解释一下。见见老师对你有好处，而且家长会也是认识其他家长的好方式。","words":[[0,2,57.91,58.08,"du"],[3,6,58.08,58.3,"kan"],[7,12,58.3,58.76,"sitte"],[13,19,58.76,59.06,"sammen"],[20,23,59.06,59.2,"med"],[24,27,59.2,59.58,"meg"],[29,31,60.1,60.26,"og"],[32,35,60.26,60.58,"jeg"],[36,39,60.58,60.76,"kan"],[40,48,60.76,61.28,"forklare"],[49,52,61.28,61.44,"deg"],[53,57,61.44,61.88,"litt~462e893626a5"],[59,62,62.58,62.74,"det~5e977a82af29"],[63,67,62.74,63.02,"blir"],[68,72,63.02,63.42,"fint"],[73,76,63.42,63.54,"for~da1a474a7e8c"],[77,80,63.54,63.9,"deg"],[81,82,63.9,64.0,"å~0583da7a620a"],[83,89,64.0,64.36,"treffe"],[90,97,64.36,64.98,"læreren"],[99,101,65.26,65.4,"og"],[102,115,65.4,66.5,"foreldremøter"],[116,118,66.5,66.66,"er"],[119,121,66.66,66.9,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[122,125,66.9,67.28,"fin"],[126,130,67.28,67.84,"måte"],[131,132,67.84,67.94,"å~0583da7a620a"],[133,136,67.94,68.16,"bli"],[137,142,68.16,68.6,"kjent~43c3ae802868"],[143,146,68.6,68.72,"med~55c996fa7248"],[147,149,68.72,68.9,"de~de84f31e2c1a"],[150,155,68.9,69.36,"andre~0c69ef1e750c"],[156,166,69.36,69.98,"foreldrene"],[167,169,69.98,70.22,"på~bd4bdf3e610e"]]},{"id":10,"start":71.6,"end":80.58,"text":"Da jeg gikk på barneskolen i Syria, hadde vi aldri foreldremøter. Hva pleier dere å snakke om når dere er på foreldremøter?","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"我在叙利亚上小学的时候，我们从来没有开过家长会。你们开家长会时一般都谈些什么？","words":[[0,2,71.66,71.9,"da~3ded9627966c"],[3,6,71.9,72.12,"jeg"],[7,11,72.12,72.38,"gikk~b33c04bf7fc2"],[12,14,72.38,72.54,"på"],[15,26,72.54,73.24,"barneskolen"],[27,28,73.24,73.36,"i"],[29,34,73.36,73.98,"syria~2ae242f98808"],[36,41,74.32,74.58,"hadde"],[42,44,74.58,74.76,"vi"],[45,50,74.76,75.18,"aldri"],[51,64,75.18,76.3,"foreldremøter"],[66,69,76.92,77.26,"hva"],[70,76,77.44,77.78,"pleier"],[77,81,77.78,78.0,"dere"],[82,83,78.0,78.12,"å~0583da7a620a"],[84,90,78.12,78.56,"snakke"],[91,93,78.56,78.78,"om~04781d07f4aa"],[94,97,78.78,78.92,"når~8cac549467d0"],[98,102,78.92,79.18,"dere"],[103,105,79.18,79.4,"er"],[106,108,79.4,79.54,"på"],[109,122,79.54,80.43,"foreldremøter"]]},{"id":11,"start":81.36,"end":91.99,"text":"Læreren pleier å snakke om klassemiljøet, om planer for året og aktiviteter som de skal ha. Vi kan også stille spørsmål til læreren.","speaker":"Kari","zh":"老师一般会谈班级氛围、这一年的计划和要开展的活动。我们也可以向老师提问。","words":[[0,7,81.42,82.02,"læreren"],[8,14,82.02,82.42,"pleier"],[15,16,82.42,82.7,"å~0583da7a620a"],[17,23,82.7,83.04,"snakke"],[24,26,83.04,83.3,"om~d7c8e64e375a"],[27,40,83.3,84.36,"klassemiljøet"],[42,44,84.82,85.0,"om~52c0bdc828db"],[45,51,85.0,85.66,"planer"],[52,55,85.66,85.88,"for~8df9de8be415"],[56,60,85.88,86.48,"året"],[61,63,86.78,86.9,"og"],[64,75,86.9,87.9,"aktiviteter"],[76,79,87.9,88.06,"som~b7970b8f941e"],[80,82,88.06,88.2,"de"],[83,87,88.2,88.4,"skal"],[88,90,88.4,88.72,"ha~f87c14118226"],[92,94,89.74,89.84,"vi"],[95,98,89.84,90.04,"kan"],[99,103,90.04,90.32,"også"],[104,110,90.32,90.62,"stille~c9c8dcefa2ae"],[111,119,90.62,91.3,"spørsmål"],[120,123,91.3,91.44,"til~10260269c38d"],[124,131,91.44,91.84,"læreren"]]},{"id":12,"start":92.95,"end":94.49,"text":"Det høres fint ut.","speaker":"Leyla","zh":"听起来不错。","words":[[0,3,93.01,93.26,"det"],[4,9,93.26,93.68,"høres~86b1ccbe85b9"],[10,14,93.68,94.0,"fint"],[15,17,94.0,94.34,"ut~ce9929451d11"]]},{"id":13,"start":95.22,"end":99.92,"text":"Ja, vi kan gå dit sammen. Det blir hyggelig.","speaker":"Kari","zh":"好，我们可以一起去。会很愉快的。","words":[[0,2,95.28,95.7,"ja"],[4,6,96.64,96.78,"vi"],[7,10,96.78,96.96,"kan"],[11,13,96.96,97.12,"gå"],[14,17,97.12,97.36,"dit"],[18,24,97.36,97.96,"sammen"],[26,29,98.82,99.06,"det"],[30,34,99.06,99.24,"blir"],[35,43,99.24,99.77,"hyggelig"]]}],"lexicon":{"13.2":{"lemma":"13.2","zh":"第 13.2 节","pos":"编号","ref":null,"clip":null,"kind":"section"},"aktiviteter":{"lemma":"aktivitet","zh":"活动","pos":"名词","ref":"13-045","form":"复数不定","clip":null},"aldri":{"lemma":"aldri","zh":"从不；从来没有","pos":"副词","ref":"basics:grammar:aldri","clip":"pronunciation/d1f5a7278af42576f5dd.mp3"},"alle":{"lemma":"all","zh":"所有的；所有人；全部","pos":"数量限定词／代词","form":"复数","ref":null,"clip":"pronunciation/2146a029ad5e62ec7869.mp3"},"alt":{"lemma":"alt","zh":"所有东西；全部；一切","pos":"代词","ref":"10-054","clip":"pronunciation/4d48fba6cf5f7d6abfb3.mp3"},"andre":{"lemma":"andre","zh":"其他的；别的（annen 的复数）；第二","pos":"代词／序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre","clip":"pronunciation/bd01b0b648c2c64eb1bd.mp3","ambiguous":true,"candidates":[{"lemma":"andre","zh":"其他的；别的（annen 的复数）；第二","pos":"代词／序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre"},{"lemma":"andre","zh":"第二","pos":"序数词","ref":"basics:ordinals:andre"},{"lemma":"annen","zh":"其他","pos":"形容词","ref":"11-037","form":"变化形式"}]},"at":{"lemma":"at","zh":"（连词）引导从句，常不译出","pos":"从属连词","ref":"12-005","clip":"pronunciation/b1d6b91b67c2afa5e322.mp3"},"barna":{"lemma":"barn","zh":"孩子","pos":"名词","ref":"basics:family:barn","form":"复数定指","clip":null},"barneskolen":{"lemma":"barneskole","zh":"小学","pos":"名词","ref":"4-056","form":"单数定指","clip":null},"bli":{"lemma":"bli","zh":"变成；成为；留下（依语境）","pos":"动词","ref":"9-068","form":"不定式","clip":"pronunciation/5f2c0653c7f703abf9ac.mp3"},"blir":{"lemma":"bli","zh":"变成；（将）会；留下","pos":"动词","ref":"5-065","form":"现在时","clip":"pronunciation/9422127081333b8048f1.mp3"},"bør":{"lemma":"burde","zh":"应该（burde 的现在时）","pos":"情态动词","ref":"pa-vei-7-088","form":"现在时","clip":"pronunciation/5e6